      "title": "epan: Use ws_abort_if_fail to satisfy static analysis in mark_truncated",
      "message": "epan: Use ws_abort_if_fail to satisfy static analysis in mark_truncated\n\nThere are problems with mark_truncated and the string is not necessarily\nproperly null truncated if the size passed in is too small. That should\nnever happen, but Coverity and other static analyzers don't believe that\nit halts when ws_assert is used. Use an unconditional assert to try to\nhint to the static analysis.\n",
